---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";
import Experience from "../../components/Experience.astro";
---

<Base printName="Byunghyun_Choi_Resume">
  <header class="mb-6">
    <h1 class="text-[26px] md:text-[34px] font-bold leading-[1.25] tracking-tight mb-5">
      A backend developer who wants to be helpful.
    </h1>
    <dl class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-y-1.5 gap-x-4 text-[14px]">
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5">
        <dt class="text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] text-[12px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">Email</dt>
        <dd>
          <a href="mailto:choi8608@gmail.com" class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2 decoration-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] hover:decoration-[var(--color-accent)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent)]">
            choi8608@gmail.com
          </a>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5">
        <dt class="text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] text-[12px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">GitHub</dt>
        <dd>
          <a href="https://github.com/Hyune-c" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2 decoration-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] hover:decoration-[var(--color-accent)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent)]">
            github.com/Hyune-c
          </a>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5">
        <dt class="text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] text-[12px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">Study</dt>
        <dd>
          <a href="https://github.com/orgs/Hyune-s-lab/repositories" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2 decoration-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] hover:decoration-[var(--color-accent)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent)]">
            github.com/Hyune-s-lab
          </a>
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </header>

  <div class="mt-10 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-[var(--color-ink)]">
    <p>
      Rather than abundant technology and structure, I prefer <strong>the minimum
      technology and structure needed to solve the problem at hand right now</strong>.<br />
      As the cost of switching technologies has dropped, the trial and error and
      operational experience gained from <strong>building and improving quickly</strong>
      become a team's greatest asset.
    </p>
    <p>
      Good design comes less from knowledge and more from <strong>operational
      experience and incremental improvement</strong>.<br />
      I treat recording problems, documenting decisions, and sharing experience with
      colleagues as importantly as writing code.<br />
      The core skill is <strong>separating the flows that humans must control from the
      areas we can delegate to AI</strong>, and managing this through documents and harnesses.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Closing the gaps in mutual understanding</strong> is what leads directly
      to business results.<br />
      Small notes and tidy summaries save colleagues' time and energy, and let everyone
      move faster from the same baseline.<br />
      So I always define problems clearly and refine them into actionable form, striving
      to be <strong>a developer people want to work with</strong>.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[14px] text-[var(--color-ink-muted)]">
      <a href="/en/portfolio/sionic-ai/05_ai-development-workflow/" class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)] underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2 decoration-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] hover:decoration-[var(--color-accent)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent)]">My thoughts on development that actively leverages AI</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <Section title="Work Experience" id="experience">
    <p slot="aside" class="text-[14.5px] text-[var(--color-ink-muted)]">
      For details, please see my <a href="/en/portfolio/" class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)] underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2 decoration-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] hover:decoration-[var(--color-accent)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent)]">portfolio</a>.
    </p>

    <Experience
      company="Sionic AI"
      role="Backend Developer"
      period="2024.09 — now"
      summary="Led OpenGateway and Storm Parse end to end — from planning to operations — working across both backend and frontend. Built the foundation for running public API products: API Key, Authn/Authz, Billing, Logs, and Model/Provider management."
    >
      <ul>
        <li>
          OpenGateway development and operations
          <span class="ml-2 text-[13px] text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)]">RPM 180 · Daily 250K · 10+ Providers / 100+ Models · Multi-deployment</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          Storm Parse development and operations
          <span class="ml-2 text-[13px] text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)]">Multi-deployment support, drove the first external SaaS revenue</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          Built operational tooling and standardized workflows
          <span class="ml-2 text-[13px] text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)]">API Hub · Test · BO operational tools, etc.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </Experience>

    <Experience
      company="Wrtn Technologies"
      role="Backend Developer"
      period="2024.01 — 2024.07"
      summary="Extended Spring AI to build an AI model serving service, and migrated an existing Node.js service to the JVM with zero downtime."
    >
      <ul>
        <li>
          AI model serving service development and operations
          <span class="ml-2 text-[13px] text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)]">RPM 750 · API response time reduced 20% · improved observability / stability</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          Company-wide common service (CDS) development and operations
          <span class="ml-2 text-[13px] text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)]">tokenizer, email validation, profanity detection</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </Experience>

    <Experience
      company="Kurly Pay"
      role="Backend Developer"
      period="2022.09 — 2023.12"
      summary="Led Kurly Pay gift cards from planning to operations, and expanded sales channels through B2C / B2B bulk purchases and partner integrations."
    >
      <ul>
        <li>Kurly Pay gift card development and operations; designed and improved the B2C / B2B bulk-send process</li>
        <li>Supported the migration of simple payment & general payment; designed prepaid charging / points</li>
      </ul>
    </Experience>

    <Experience
      company="Marketboro"
      role="Backend Developer"
      period="2021.08 — 2022.08"
    >
      <ul>
        <li>Developed and operated the B2B platform Marketbom Pro; introduced Datadog company-wide</li>
      </ul>
    </Experience>

    <Experience
      company="Oasis Business"
      role="Backend Developer"
      period="2021.02 — 2021.08"
    >
      <ul>
        <li>Developed the Trade Area Analysis & It땅 mobile web / admin; integrated 050 Biz Call and SmartCon</li>
      </ul>
    </Experience>

    <Experience
      company="AlbaCheck (now HIGHERX)"
      role="Backend Developer"
      period="2020.08 — 2021.02"
    >
      <ul>
        <li>Developed the AlbaCheck app / admin; led the 1st National G-Coder Contest (with GS25)</li>
      </ul>
    </Experience>

    <Experience
      company="SI Development & Infrastructure"
      role="SI Development, IT Operations, Technical Support"
    >
      <ul class="si-list space-y-2 !list-none !pl-0">
        <li class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:items-baseline gap-x-5">
          <span>
            <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Kakao Pay</strong>
            <span class="text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] ml-2">Supported merchant & reseller screening / settlement / reconciliation integrations</span>
          </span>
          <time class="text-[13px] font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap">2019.04 — 2019.07</time>
        </li>
        <li class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:items-baseline gap-x-5">
          <span>
            <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">FirstData Korea (now Korea Payment Networks)</strong>
            <span class="text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] ml-2">Operated a VAN authorization system supporting all card companies</span>
          </span>
          <time class="text-[13px] font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap">2016.09 — 2019.04</time>
        </li>
        <li class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:items-baseline gap-x-5">
          <span>
            <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">Hana INS (now Hana Financial TI)</strong>
            <span class="text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] ml-2">Developed the Hana Bank open banking project; operated Hana Life servers and middleware</span>
          </span>
          <time class="text-[13px] font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] tabular-nums whitespace-nowrap">2012.01 — 2016.08</time>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </Experience>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Education" id="education">
    <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-[14.5px]">
      <li class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:items-baseline gap-x-6">
        <span>
          <strong class="font-semibold">CodeSquad</strong>
          <span class="text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] ml-2">Developer Bootcamp</span>
        </span>
        <time class="text-[13px] font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] tabular-nums">
          2020.01 — 2020.06
        </time>
      </li>
      <li class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:items-baseline gap-x-6">
        <span>
          <strong class="font-semibold">Kwangwoon University</strong>
          <span class="text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] ml-2">B.S. in Computer Software, GPA 3.29 / 4.5</span>
        </span>
        <time class="text-[13px] font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] tabular-nums">
          2006.03 — 2012.02
        </time>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Certifications" id="certifications">
    <p class="text-[14.5px]">
      <span class="font-medium">Engineer Information Processing</span>
      <span class="text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] font-mono ml-2">2012.11</span>
      <span class="mx-3 text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)]">·</span>
      <span class="font-medium">SQLD</span>
      <span class="text-[var(--color-ink-subtle)] font-mono ml-2">2017.12</span>
    </p>
  </Section>

</Base>
